WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:10.812
Mandy was taken into a room full of women.

2
00:00:10.813 --> 00:00:15.802
They were taking off their clothes and putting on thin robes.

3
00:00:15.803 --> 00:00:22.765
Women and girls were talking and laughing.

4
00:00:22.766 --> 00:00:26.742
"Time to bathe," the woman said.

5
00:00:26.743 --> 00:00:30.605
"I just had a bath," said Mandy.

6
00:00:30.606 --> 00:00:33.884
But the woman ignored her and left.

7
00:00:33.885 --> 00:00:39.023
Mandy walked through a hallway and started looking around.

8
00:00:39.024 --> 00:00:43.803
"What is Vinnie doing?" Mandy wondered.

9
00:00:43.804 --> 00:00:47.644
Vinnie was also in the bathhouse.

10
00:00:47.645 --> 00:00:52.157
He was sitting in a large bathing pool with some men.

11
00:00:52.158 --> 00:00:54.551
No women were there.

12
00:00:54.552 --> 00:00:59.918
Some men were lying on tables getting rubbed with oil.

13
00:00:59.919 --> 00:01:02.540
Others were exercising.

14
00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:07.029
Most of the men just sat in the pools talking.

15
00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:10.604
"Ah, there is nothing like a hot bath,"

16
00:01:10.605 --> 00:01:14.154
said a young man sitting next to Vinnie.

17
00:01:14.155 --> 00:01:17.114
Vinnie smiled nervously.

18
00:01:17.115 --> 00:01:20.945
He wasn't comfortable bathing with strangers.

19
00:01:20.946 --> 00:01:29.307
"Some say Asian baths are better," continued the young man, "but I say Roman baths are the best."

20
00:01:29.308 --> 00:01:33.029
"The best in the world!" someone said.

21
00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:38.040
Everyone cheered.

22
00:01:38.041 --> 00:01:41.609
"We're in Rome!" thought Vinnie.

23
00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:45.255
"I'm Varius," said the young man.

24
00:01:45.256 --> 00:01:50.207
"Hi," said Vinnie, introducing himself.

25
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:55.274
Mandy kept her clothes on and walked through a doorway.

26
00:01:55.275 --> 00:01:59.233
It led her into a large steam room.

27
00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:04.969
Women were silently sitting on benches enjoying the warm room.

28
00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:10.086
But two women were whispering, and Mandy could hear them.

29
00:02:10.087 --> 00:02:14.082
"It's all set," one of the women said.

30
00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:17.674
"The poison will be put into the horses' water."

31
00:02:17.675 --> 00:02:21.407
"How?" said the other woman.

32
00:02:21.408 --> 00:02:26.031
Mandy could not hear what the first woman said next.

33
00:02:26.032 --> 00:02:28.666
"Aquila will lose the race.

34
00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:30.882
Brutus will be the champion!"

35
00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:33.940
said the other woman excitedly.

36
00:02:33.941 --> 00:02:36.869
Mandy was very upset.

37
00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.269
Someone was going to poison horses!

38
00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:44.402
She had to find Vinnie.

39
00:02:44.403 --> 00:02:49.084
Vinnie was now outside the bathhouse with Varius.

40
00:02:49.085 --> 00:02:53.001
Suddenly, Mandy came running up to them.

41
00:02:53.002 --> 00:02:57.336
"I heard something in the bathhouse," she cried.

42
00:02:57.337 --> 00:03:01.205
"Calm down," said her brother.

43
00:03:01.206 --> 00:03:04.884
He introduced Mandy to Varius.

44
00:03:04.885 --> 00:03:08.954
"Why are you upset?" asked Varius.

45
00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:12.297
Mandy told them what she had heard.

46
00:03:12.298 --> 00:03:17.912
"Why would anyone poison horses?" she cried.

47
00:03:17.913 --> 00:03:23.301
"Are you certain you heard the names Aquila and Brutus?" Varius asked.

48
00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:25.276
Mandy nodded.

49
00:03:25.277 --> 00:03:28.874
"Who are they?" said Vinnie.

50
00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:33.560
"Aquila is the chariot-race champion," answered Varius.

51
00:03:33.561 --> 00:03:36.881
"Brutus hates Aquila because he cannot beat him.

52
00:03:36.882 --> 00:03:39.677
We must stop this wicked plan."

53
00:03:39.678 --> 00:03:42.534
"But how?" asked Vinnie.

54
00:03:42.535 --> 00:03:47.003
"Septimus will know what to do," said Varius.

55
00:03:47.004 --> 00:03:50.616
"He is a censor and my father's good friend."

56
00:03:50.617 --> 00:03:54.283
"A censor?" Mandy said.

57
00:03:54.284 --> 00:03:59.020
"A censor protects Roman citizens and makes sure they obey the law."

58
00:03:59.021 --> 00:04:04.815
"Do they protect horses too?" said Mandy, worried.

59
00:04:04.816 --> 00:04:08.561
"Yes, they do," smiled Varius.

60
00:04:08.562 --> 00:04:12.743
"Where do we find the censor?" asked Vinnie.

61
00:04:12.744 --> 00:04:19.980
"At the forum," Varius replied.
